MFLOW 2
NAME Gravity merge/overflow
POPUP 1 2 2 How it works
POPUPTEXT 1 Feeder 1 drops water by gravity through a\none-way pipe and a 2-way valve.\nFeeder 2 holds oil and fluff; a blower pushes\nthem through a narrow section into the tee.\nBoth streams leave by the drop outlet into a\nsmall bucket, which overflows into the tray.
POPUP 2 0 3 Try this
POPUPTEXT 2 Select the 2-way valve and shut it.\nMouse wheel on the blower: change its strength.\nWiden the narrow section (Pipe size tool).\nHide the Notes layer (F6) to see the process.

